2025-03-07 21:42:51,171 - __main__ - INFO - Sent response: 'Loubby is a job navigation tool that provides a recruitment portal for job seekers and an employee portal for hired candidates. In the recruitment portal, job seekers can apply to various positions, and once they have a scheduled interview, they can access the virtual interview room. To do this, they should log in to Loubby 15 minutes before the interview, go to "My Applications" in the dashboard, find the relevant application, and click "Join Interview" when the button becomes active. They can also access Loubby on mobile devices by using the responsive web version or downloading the Loubby mobile app from the App Store or Google Play.

The employee portal offers features such as onboarding and internal feedback summaries (for internal use only). Onboarding helps new hires familiarize themselves with the company and their role. Internal feedback summaries are used for sharing feedback among employees, with recent feedback including critiques about the 'ai video' and praise for the 'nice interface.'

The term "lobby" is unrelated to the Loubby platform features.'
